    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "はあ……ウララさん。\n結局今日のトレーニング\n間に合ったのかしら……。",
            "enText": "<i>Sigh…</i> I hope Urara made it \nto training on time…",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 3276800641298381961,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "出る前に起こしては来たけど、\nまさか三度寝してるんじゃ――",
            "enText": "I woke her up before I left, but what if \nshe fell asleep aga—",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -5257636987804868545,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "んもう、やめやめ。この一流の\nキングが気にすることじゃないわ。",
            "enText": "No, no, stop that. A first-rate horsegirl like \nme shouldn't be worrying about that.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4420915294566234632,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "……明日こそ自分で、\n起きてもらいましょう。",
            "enText": "…Starting tomorrow, she'll have to \nwake herself up.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -6023879697712790838,
            "blockIdx": 4
        }
    ],
